    {
      "content": "You know during the summer it is our busiest time of the busiest season does get a very physically demanding a lot of it is you know it gets hot things are heavy but a lot of it is just keeping a good attitude when you're through, when you're having fun it sucks a little less. You know just moving heavy stuff in the heat sucks a little bit. So, you know have the guys you know being as, as close as they are and you know we've worked very hard to build a culture ground and teamwork in cam. It's something that helps to, to kind of get through those tough days. But a lot of, a lot of soreness a lot of sledding those are kinda typical things to expect some days are long, some days are short, but really it's just kinda it's gonna boil down to you know each day is a little bit different but the same kind of cadence the same.",
