      "content": "What we do, so you know, as far as the first couple of weeks, it's a lot of learning a lot of, just kind of learning the basics. Wrapping, furniture, Dolly, technique things like that. Just learning the flow of the day. Beyond that then it's all very pretty straightforward with regards to, you know, load up the truck, with the person's things. Drive to the other spot and unload it everyday. Very straightforward we do.",
