    {
      "content": "In the morning we'll get here at 7:35 take that time to clock in take the next 2030 minutes to get the truck ready to get everything that you need for the day. We're usually aiming to leave here at 8:05 at the latest I between 8:00 and 805, leaving your office get to the customer's house between around 8:30 starting the job to the walk through with the customer and then just each day that's where it kinda gets its own unique kind of the day, the days start on their own after that, you know, generally we'll have either one large job or two smaller jobs. We're never gonna intentionally aim to have everyone, you know, we're always gonna aim to have everyone back between 4:30 and 630 someday are going to be a little longer. But we won't intentionally schedule anyone to get back at you know, 10:00 PM midnight. In those instances we do what we can to shorten day you know, add another day, bring out support help shorten that day for you on that day.",
